# Allow only the API source, native build inputs, and tetrahedral grid.
# In particular, do not send credentials, caches, uploads, or .git to the builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements-inference.txt
!requirements-api.txt
!api_server.py
!api_backend.py
!LICENSE.md
!sf3d/
!sf3d/**
!texture_baker/
!texture_baker/**
!uv_unwrapper/
!uv_unwrapper/**
!load/
!load/tets/
!load/tets/*.npz

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
**/build/
**/dist/
**/*.egg-info/
